{"id":1160503,"name":"嘟嘟·审查Ⅲ","type":"trial","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"嘟嘟·审查Ⅲ","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1160503]}],"trial":{"trial_id":160503,"stage":"阶段3","unlock_time":"2023-03-07 14:00:00","diary1":"你与嘟嘟一同潜入流民寨西北面废弃已久的破楼进行调查，你们是否能够成功揭开“帕拉马”的神秘面纱？","diary2":"“帕拉马”竟是老太太已经死去多年的孙子，而当你们带着被她遗漏在废楼里的照片和日记匆匆赶到她的住处时，却发现她已然在睡梦中断了呼吸。\n　　嘟嘟遵照约定为她吹响了最后一支唢呐曲。正如嘟嘟的师父曾经说过的那样，死亡不是生命的终点，遗忘才是。而老太太和帕拉马的故事也将在你们的记忆之中永存下去。","evidence":[{"ID":260317,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260318,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260503001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260503002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260503003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260503004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260503005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260503006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":3,"dialogue_id":260503007,"next":[8]},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260503008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260503009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260503010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260503011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260503012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260503013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260503014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260503015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260503016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":3,"dialogue_id":260503017,"next":[18]},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260503018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260503019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260503020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260503021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260503022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260503023,"next":null},{"step":24,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260503024,"next":null},{"step":25,"co